<title>USA: Walker, Mich., won by First of America. [CORRECTED 22:00 GMT]</title>
<headline>Walker, Mich., won by First of America. [CORRECTED 22:00 GMT]</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects company name in headline and text from Zions Bank)</p>
<p>First of America said it won $1.890 million of Walker, Mich., special assessment general obligation Taxable limited tax bonds, Series 1996 A, with a net interest cost of 6.3717 (corrects from 6.37) percent.</p>
</text>
